
# Revoke @ACL_SUBJECT@'s access to @SERVICE_CODE@ -- reversal of
# SERVICE_ACL.hurl.tmpl (join-c plan Task 2). Same body shape as the grant
# (apps/console/xroad.py's revoke(), confirmed live). CONFIRMED LIVE
# (apps/join-api/tests/fixtures/xroad/unjoin.acl_revoke.json,
# docs/xroad-770-notes.md #11): 204 on the first attempt, no retry.
# Repeating this call is safe: apps/console/tests/fixtures/xroad/
# revoke_409_not_found.json records 409 accessright_not_found on an
# already-revoked right.
POST https://{{@HOSTVAR@}}:4000/api/v1/clients/{{@CAP_P@_client_id}}/service-clients/@ACL_SUBJECT@/access-rights/delete
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{@SESS_P@_xsrf_token}}
{
  "items": [
    {
      "service_code": "@SERVICE_CODE@"
    }
  ]
}

HTTP 204
